cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Analysis code for: auditing photovoltaic registries with remote sensing"
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper it implements."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kasmi
    given-names: Gabriel
    email: gabriel.kasmi@minesparis.psl.eu
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7774-4302"
    affiliation: "Mines Paris-PSL"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gabrielkasmi/pv-registry-audit"
abstract: >-
  Full analysis code for a national audit of rooftop photovoltaic registries by
  remote sensing: detection evaluation against 31,853 manual annotations,
  Bayesian correction of the detected capacity, comparison against two official
  registries with a specification battery, and the attribution of the flagged
  discrepancies to observable mechanisms. The replication dataset is deposited
  separately.
